SUMMARY:16th Annual Hendersonville Oktoberfest 
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nSaturday\, September 26\n**16th Annual Hend
 ersonville Oktoberfest at Southern Appalachian Brewery**\nNoon-6:30pm\, So
 uthern Appalachian Brewery\, 822 Locust St\, Hendersonville\nGates open at
  Noon. The Appalachian Freund Polka Band will play from 1 to 6 pm. Come ge
 t your Polka on.\nCostume contest! Stein Hoist Competition! Dachshund Dog 
 Racing (sponsored by Wag! A Unique Pet\nBoutique to benefit Blue Ridge Hum
 ane Society)\, Wiener Toss! And more! Beers – Our Seasonal Autumn Beer\,
  Hefeweizen\, Pilsner\, Fest and one guest Oktoberfest beer. A commerative
  Oktoberfest Stein/mug will be available for purchase. Food available - Ha
 us Heidelberg and Underground Baking (Bretzel Bus).\n**$10 entry fee** & u
 nder 21 with parents are FREE.
