SUMMARY:*INFO* Honor Flight Welcome Home Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nSaturday\, April 18\nParking begins at 7:45
 \nAsheville Regional Airport\, Fletcher\, NC\n\nCome out and welcome home 
 the veterans from Blue Ridge Honor Flight. If you have never attended one 
 of these events\, we guarantee that it will be something you will never fo
 rget!\n\nThere will be free parking and shuttles from Gate 7 at the WNC Ag
  Center. We will be landing at the Signature Air Hangar at the [Asheville 
 Regional Airport](https://www.facebook.com/FlyAVL?__cft__%5B0%5D=AZWOTzPHN
 eV6ZnDFtpDq5rD2HMOCHunAbYPlCq7hY7mfcCVbA77I9sQsw21ibQkIp0UWLE6u-Hgz3JTDO80
 zx7EMeL0kSDOvbNEFbo6FCf2iMcudsl9ibUf2sWLH41gR_ldpkVE_H9-NJncljt7joj5Mw0_97
 En6XlTOhg9ccG3olRj7Z8yspIkUg1eNjizmRtA&__tn__=-%5DK-R) following our fligh
 t to Washington D.C.\n\nThis part of the day is the only thing that can't 
 be organized in advance and it means a lot to the veterans who go on this 
 trip to have friendly faces welcoming them home.\n\nWear patriotic colors\
 , make signs and welcome home local vets!
