SUMMARY:Amble and Ramble 
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nJoin us to get your steps in\, meet new fri
 ends and engage in lively conversation on the Oklawaha Greenway.\nWalkers 
 meet in the Patton Park parking lot. Walking distances vary (generally fou
 r miles)\, but we are usually done in 1.5 hrs. The pathway is paved.\nSoci
 alized dogs on leash are welcome.\n**Weather cancellations will be posted 
 at 6:30am.**
